<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of four-week treasury bills on Wednesday, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The ministry did not announce a maximum or expected yield but in the last successful auction of four-week T-bills on February 12, the average yield hit 13.957 percent. -- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-5218-402</p>
</text>
